  "notes": "Version 1 stopped fail-closed with zero trained models. Versions 2-4 exposed successive host-memory peaks with zero reusable models. Version 5 completed all ten models after moving clean273 base features to a temporary float32 memmap. The bounded stack improved pooled RMSE and all five folds/scopes, but failed the preregistered by-well p95 and worst-well guards, so exp413 remains the scientific selection and the conditional gate and same-OOF rescue remain closed. A later explicit user override authorized unchanged constant-stack hidden inference and one reference submission while retaining that scientific FAIL. Inference v1 completed without fallback or inference-time training and passed submission checks. Submission ref 55134873 completed at Public LB 7.228, 0.027 worse than exp413 7.201, so exp494 is not adopted and exp413 remains the overall and ML submitted anchor. As the best scored ensemble-route submission, exp494 replaces exp082 only as the ensemble-route Public-LB reference, not as a robust scientific selection. The reproducibility manifest correctly hashes models, OOF, weights, and downloaded evidence except its exp494_train_metrics.json artifact entry, which reflects the pre-final-rewrite metrics file; the final metrics file and manifest cross-link remain independently recorded."
